  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together teriyaki sauce, syrup, sesame oil, soy sauce, sugar, and garlic.",
    "3. Add pork cubes to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "4. Thread pork cubes onto skewers, leaving a small space between each cube.",
    "5. Brush kebabs with sesame oil and season with salt and pepper.",
    "6. Grill kebabs for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, or until cooked through.",
    "7. Brush with teriyaki sauce during the last 2 minutes of grilling.",
    "8. Garnish with green onions and serve with additional teriyaki sauce on the side."
